Z||000000||daved||01-20-2000||10:41 PM||||If you are looking for the ultimate in brakes, look no further!  These are monster Porsche caliper equipped kits....but they are not cheap.  Try a whopping US$2,795<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ultimategarage.com/bigbrake1.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ultimategarage.com/bigbrake1.html</A> <P>More interesting to our members, is the discussion on what constitutes the best balance in braking, their knowlegable staff point out you can have a serious problem with too much brake! See "Application Guide", and scroll down to "General FAQ's"<P>Dave||||reg||1
