Z||000003||WKDFIRO||01-21-2000||12:07 AM||||Brakes for more than some Fieros cost? Even for the Northstar engine upgrade I would go with the Grand Am brakes with cross drilled and slotted rotors and STILL have enough to but a beatup fixer upper Fiero!<P>But I am intrigued with the idea of "too much brake." Does that mean you could lock up your wheels at 140 mph?  THAT would be too much brake...||||reg||11
Z||000004||Carrolles||01-21-2000||06:38 AM||||A while back on of the Space Coast Fiero club members posted an article about retrofitting Toronado calipers and rotors to the Fiero.  This gave large piston calipers, vented rotors, and an e-brake.||||reg||1
